# Russian fixture of the window under a second language (#664): every top-level menu title, the
# submenus, a sample of actions with their accelerators, of the toolbar's words and tool tips, the
# columns of the table and of `View ▸ Columns`, and the status line with a count, in three plural
# forms. Then (#665) every word the dialogs and the pages of `Correct Texts…` show, the prompts,
# the core's words they borrow, sentences with a count in three forms, and one whose arguments
# Russian puts in the other order. Where Russian writes two forms alike, the second carries a mark, « (форма 2–4) », so that a
# test can tell which form was chosen.
#
# Compiled by msgfmt at the build into a locale directory of the window tests, laid out as an
# installation is: `ru/LC_MESSAGES/subedit.mo` (src/test/gui/CMakeLists.txt).
msgid ""
msgstr ""
