msgid ""
"The subtitles that repeat each other are joined first, and the rest put in "
"order of their start. Overlapping subtitles are cut where they overlap, and "
"what shows together is merged line by line, the earliest first. Nothing is "
"shortened or lengthened. Each change can be undone."
